Buildroot 2011.11-rc3 is released - Go download it at:

http://buildroot.net/downloads/buildroot-2011.11-rc3.tar.gz

or

http://buildroot.net/downloads/buildroot-2011.11-rc3.tar.bz2

Or get it from Git:

git://git.buildroot.net/buildroot

Another week, another release candidate. I know I mentioned in the RC2
notes that it would most likely be the last RC before the 2011.11, but
we had quite some fixes added since, so I decided to make another one.

Please give it a spin and report any problems to the mailing list or
bug tracker. Many thanks to the people contributing to this release:

